{"id": "t088-045", "text": "Jess and her bf Theo split up - his call apparently, out of nowhere. she's moving back to her mum's on 30th, mum's place in Croydon. she's pretty low, not eating much. Theo keeping the flat. don't forget to invite her for dinner the wknd after the move", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jess", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "bf", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "split up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving back", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "30th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "place in Croydon", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "pretty low", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "not eating much", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "invite her for dinner", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the wknd after the move", "anchor": "a1"}]}
