{"id": "t088-048", "text": "chat w Afua: her twins start reception in Sept, both @ St Mary's. her mum's moving in to help. Afua's back at work 3 days. her husband away w work most of Oct. she sounded frazzled, said she's not sleeping. offer to have the twins one Sat", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Afua", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "twins", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "reception", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in Sept", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving in", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Afua", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "back at work 3 days", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "away w work", "owner": "r3", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "most of Oct", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "frazzled", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "not sleeping", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "offer to have the twins", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "r4", "type": "RELATION", "text": "twins", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "one Sat", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t088-049", "text": "Esther - hip replacement 4/03 @ 7.30am. Natasha taking her in. Esther worried about anaesthetic, had bad reaction b4. I should ring her the night before + pop round wk after with flowers", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esther", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip replacement", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "4/03 @ 7.30am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Natasha", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esther", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried about anaesthetic", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "had bad reaction", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "b4"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "pop round", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "wk after", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t088-057", "text": "Santiago - mum's chemo starts 10/11, every 3 wks for 6 cycles. he's flying to Bogotá on the 8th to be with her, back early Dec. his sister Sofia staying longer. he's trying to work remotely from there but worried. need to message him the day after first session, then maybe every couple of wks. also cover his 5 a side spot", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Santiago", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "chemo", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "10/11", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every 3 wks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying to Bogotá", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 8th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "early Dec", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sofia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after first session", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "every couple of wks", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "cover his 5 a side spot", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}]}
